---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/content";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Ragib Badaruddin and this site.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Ragib, a software engineer in Malaysia. Outside work, I build and run
    small things that other people use: a{" "}
    <a href="/projects/#bancuh-dns">public adblock DNS service</a>, a{" "}
    <a href="/projects/#simplesolat">prayer times app</a>, an
    <a href="/projects/#gibtalk">app for communicating without speaking</a>, and
    the <a href="/projects/#homelab">homelab</a> they mostly run on.
  </p>
  <p>
    Looking back, that's a lot of things learned the slow way, and most of it
    only lives in commit messages and old GitHub issues. This site is where I
    write it down: what I built, what went wrong, and what I'd do differently.
    Not advice, just notes.
  </p>
  <p>
    For my work history, see <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>. For code, see{" "}
    <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>This site</h2>
  <p>
    Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> and served as static
    files from the homelab, deployed with Flux. No analytics, no cookies. The{" "}
    <a href={SITE.source}>source is on GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
